Description: Relax and port to the crate set available in UOS 25
 The Debian patch series is written against the crate versions available in
 Debian sid. UOS 25 (snipe) ships older versions for 15 of maturin 1.8.3's
 direct dependencies, so both `cargo generate-lockfile --offline` and the
 subsequent rustc run fail.
 .
 This patch relaxes those 15 version constraints to the versions actually
 available in UOS 25 and ports the affected source code back to the older
 APIs:
 .
  * Cargo.toml: cargo_metadata 0.19.0->0.15.4, fat-macho 0.4.8->0.4.7,
    fs-err 3.0.0->2.11.0, goblin 0.9.0->0.7.1, lddtree 0.3.7->0.3.3,
    minijinja 2.5.0->1.0.3, pep440_rs 0.7->0.6.6, pep508_rs 0.9->0.6.1,
    pyproject-toml 0.13.4->0.11.0, python-pkginfo 0.6.5->0.6.3,
    semver 1.0.22->1.0.21, thiserror 2.0.3->1.0.59, zip 2.0.0->0.6.6,
    fs4 0.11->0.8.4, which 6->4.2.5
  * src/compile.rs, src/build_context.rs, src/build_options.rs,
    src/pyproject_toml.rs: cargo_metadata 0.15 has no CrateType/TargetKind
    enums, use plain strings instead
  * src/module_writer.rs: zip 0.6 provides FileOptions, not SimpleFileOptions
  * src/develop.rs, src/metadata.rs: pep440_rs 0.6/pep508_rs 0.6 have no
    simplify_extras/ExtraOperator/MarkerValueExtra, restore the older
    marker handling
  * src/metadata.rs, src/source_distribution.rs, src/pyproject_toml.rs:
    pyproject-toml 0.11 License/Contact API
